# Documentation (track selected files only)
*.md
!README.md
!DATABASE_SETUP.md
!public/SHUFFLE-IMPLEMENTATION.md
!Inhibition_copy.md

# Superpowers specs and plans are the design record and are always tracked.
# Without this, the blanket *.md above silently swallows them: the three specs
# committed before 2026-08-10 each had to be forced past it with `git add -f`,
# and a spec that is merely *written* looks identical to one that is committed
# until you go looking for it.
!docs/superpowers/**/*.md

# Allow project configuration tracked in this repository
!package.json
!package-lock.json
.playwright-mcp/
**/.playwright-mcp/

# Python bytecode -- was tracked by accident
__pycache__/
*.pyc
